 published noise floor percentage or thermal fluctuation rate for this specific experimental setup in literature?
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
* Would you like me to calculate the 95% Confidence Intervals for your other three subsets to see if the noise level remains stable across different sample sizes?
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
